WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:07.857
Ringo was in the library.

2
00:00:07.858 --> 00:00:11.673
"It's time to work," he said.

3
00:00:11.674 --> 00:00:15.355
The rookies had to write a planet report.

4
00:00:15.356 --> 00:00:18.755
Ringo was trying to choose a planet.

5
00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:25.326
Whoopa-tweet! Whoopa-tweet!

6
00:00:25.327 --> 00:00:28.622
Ringo groaned.

7
00:00:28.623 --> 00:00:31.340
"The clamor birds!

8
00:00:31.341 --> 00:00:34.977
Why do they live next to the library?"

9
00:00:34.978 --> 00:00:38.109
The birds made lots of noise.

10
00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:41.357
Ringo put his hands over his ears.

11
00:00:41.358 --> 00:00:43.755
He tried to read.

12
00:00:43.756 --> 00:00:46.171
Crash!

13
00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:54.090
"Ugh!" Ringo got up.

14
00:00:54.091 --> 00:01:02.102
He went into the clamor birds' room.

15
00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:05.177
The birds stood on desks.

16
00:01:05.178 --> 00:01:07.600
A chair lay on the floor.

17
00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:11.138
"What are you doing?" Ringo asked.

18
00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:15.035
"We're playing Hot Lava!" one bird said.

19
00:01:15.036 --> 00:01:17.502
Ringo rolled his eyes.

20
00:01:17.503 --> 00:01:23.510
"I'm trying to work on—"

21
00:01:23.511 --> 00:01:26.182
Just then Captain Nova called.

22
00:01:26.183 --> 00:01:35.258
"Come to my office, Ringo!"

23
00:01:35.259 --> 00:01:40.534
"Volcano Planet is safe," Captain Nova said.

24
00:01:40.535 --> 00:01:43.691
"You can take the clamor birds home."

25
00:01:43.692 --> 00:01:50.775
Ringo grinned. "Yes!"

26
00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:55.151
He ran back to the clamor birds.

27
00:01:55.152 --> 00:01:58.185
"Good news!" Ringo said.

28
00:01:58.186 --> 00:02:02.530
"I'm taking you back to Volcano Planet!"

29
00:02:02.531 --> 00:02:04.691
The birds frowned.

30
00:02:04.692 --> 00:02:08.120
"No way!" one bird said.

31
00:02:08.121 --> 00:02:14.872
"We like it here!"

